  "notes": "## 0.18.0-alpha.3 - 2026-07-04\n\n### Features\n\n- Keep clipboard previews, file names, links, and file paths encrypted in the local search index for stronger privacy at rest (#1292)\n- Replace mobile device dialogs with an inline Devices page panel that keeps pairing, device details, copy actions, and sync settings in one place (#1291)\n- Limit automatic update popups so frequent alpha releases are less disruptive, while manual update checks still show results immediately (#1287)\n\n<!-- zh -->\n\n## 0.18.0-alpha.3 - 2026-07-04\n\n### Features\n\n- 本地搜索索引中的剪贴板预览、文件名、链接和文件路径现在会加密保存，增强静态数据隐私保护 (#1292)\n- 设备页改为内联面板，把移动设备配对、设备详情、复制操作和同步设置集中在同一处 (#1291)\n- 自动更新弹窗增加频率限制，减少频繁 Alpha 发版带来的打扰；手动检查更新仍会立即显示结果 (#1287)",
